{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"removeGeoJSONSourceFeatures"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"forSourceId","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"sourceId","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"featureIds","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"text":"dataId","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil)"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A style source identifier."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"sourceId"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Ids of the features that need to be removed from the source."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"featureIds"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An arbitrary string used to track the given GeoJSON data.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"dataId"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The remove operation will be scheduled and applied on a GeoJSON serialization queue."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In order to capture events when actual data is drawn on the map please refer to Events API","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and listen to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onSourceDataLoaded"},{"type":"text","text":" (optionally pass the "},{"code":"dataId","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter to filter the events)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","tex